WEBVTT

00:05:00.338 --> 00:05:03.924
But too much porn can desensitize you
from real-life pleasures.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.094
Or, "I'm 24 years old

00:05:07.136 --> 00:05:10.139
and my friends make fun of me
because I'm a virgin.

00:05:10.181 --> 00:05:13.934
Should I have sex
just to gain popularity?"

00:05:13.934 --> 00:05:15.311
Absolutely not.

00:05:16.145 --> 00:05:18.647
First of all, virginity
is a social construct.

00:05:19.648 --> 00:05:22.818
And I think you should have
your sexual debut --

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.028
(Applause)

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.237
thank you --

00:05:25.279 --> 00:05:27.323
when you’re good and ready to.

00:05:27.365 --> 00:05:31.952
A lot of the time, we have a lot of fun
on the podcast, honestly.